### 第二步：加分块二值化函数

```c
void BinaryZation_Block(int start_row, int end_row, uint8 threshold)
{
    for (int i = start_row; i < end_row; i++)
    {
        for (int j = 0; j < MT9V03X_1_W; j++)
        {
            imageindex[i][j] = (mt9v03x_image_1[i][j] < threshold) ? 0 : 255;
        }
    }
}
```

