### 第三步：修改 `image_invocation()`

```c
void image_invocation()
{
    int h = MT9V03X_1_H;
    int block_h = h / 3;   // 分 3 块

    for (int block = 0; block < 3; block++)
    {
        int start_row = block * block_h;
        int end_row   = (block == 2) ? h : start_row + block_h;

        uint8 thresh = Otsu_Block(mt9v03x_image_1, start_row, end_row);
        BinaryZation_Block(start_row, end_row, thresh);
    }

    follow_bianjie(imageindex);
    judge_num_where();
}
```

